TITLE 1D transport: Ca-Cl initial, Na-Cl inflow, cation exchange in all cells

SOLUTION 0  Inflow
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -time_step 1
    -print_frequency 10
    -punch_frequency 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -step true

USER_PUNCH
    -headings a_Na_sol3
10 PUNCH ACT("Na+")

END
